Results files:
--------------
1. 'test-results-unix.out' contains the results of running the 'tests.py'
script under Linux.  If you ran 'tests.py' under Linux, your results should
match these exactly.

2. 'test-results-win32.out' contains the results of running the 'tests.py'
script under Windows.  If you ran 'tests.py' under Windows, your results
should match these exactly.

3. 'full-results.out' contains the results of running the 'trials.py' script
under Linux.  If you ran 'trials.py' under Linux, your results should match
these exactly, if you ran it under another operating system, your results be
close.  The most significant digit should always be the same.